{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28925","headline":"泛舟寻郁林寺道玄上人遇雨而返因寄 · 许浑","name":"泛舟寻郁林寺道玄上人遇雨而返因寄","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"禅扉倚石梯，云湿雨凄凄。\n草色分松迳，泉声咽稻畦。\n棹移滩鸟没，钟断岭猨啼。\n入夜花如雪，回舟忆剡溪。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"许浑","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_28925.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28925","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}